--- !u!114 &756812950
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 756812946}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 16f9dd11d00ca466d993daebdb3dee31, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  instructionPanel: {fileID: 756812946}
  pageImage: {fileID: 2100875482}
  pageTitleText: {fileID: 2035809327}
  pageBodyText: {fileID: 1781011607}
  pageNumberText: {fileID: 1847475374}
  prevButton: {fileID: 2079322265}
  nextButton: {fileID: 1370460927}
  closeButton: {fileID: 1566076837}
  pages:
  - title: Win the Match
    body: 'Use your strategy cards and tower to protect your castle.


      Defeat
      enemies to earn score.


      The player with the highest score wins.'
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 62bf77a78e90f40dbb3a409f1a8c1103, type: 3}
  - title: Round Flow
    body: 'Players take turns first.


      After all turns are finished,

      the
      enemy wave begins.'
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 62bf77a78e90f40dbb3a409f1a8c1103, type: 3}
  - title: Trade Hands
    body: "Effect: Swap your entire hand with another player\u2019s hand.\nDuration:
      Instant effect.\nNotes: Can be used even if one player has zero cards."
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c9348675a600403e937bd112c50c238, type: 3}
  - title: Your Turn
    body: 'Build Towers


      Upgrade Towers


      Play Cards


      Control
      Gates


      End Turn'
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 62bf77a78e90f40dbb3a409f1a8c1103, type: 3}
  - title: Player HUD
    body: 'Health

      Protect your castle.


      Gold

      Build and upgrade.


      Cards

      Your
      tactical options.


      Score

      Determines the winner.'
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 62bf77a78e90f40dbb3a409f1a8c1103, type: 3}
  - title: Building Areas
    body: 'Claimable Land (Blue point)

      Buy first, then build.


      Public
      Area (Red point)

      Build immediately.'
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 62bf77a78e90f40dbb3a409f1a8c1103, type: 3}
  - title: Control Routes
    body: 'Gates change enemy paths.


      Protect yourself.


      Redirect enemies
      toward opponents.'
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 62bf77a78e90f40dbb3a409f1a8c1103, type: 3}
  - title: Build Tower
    body: 'Choose a tower.


      Confirm your purchase.


      Upgrade existing
      towers.


      Sell towers for partial refund.'
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 62bf77a78e90f40dbb3a409f1a8c1103, type: 3}
  - title: Enemy Waves
    body: 'Enemies become stronger over time.


      Different enemy types require
      different defenses.


      Prepare before the next wave arrives.'
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 62bf77a78e90f40dbb3a409f1a8c1103, type: 3}
  - title: Mode Select
    body: 'Local mode: play with your four friends in turn in one computer.


      AI
      mode: add the AI player in your game room and be ready to play.


      Network
      Matching: click the matching button and match the human players to play together.'
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e6a922eee25a64a578fefd5cc5ff89ce, type: 3}
  - title: AI Player Mode
    body: "Click \"add AI Player\" to add the AI, and adjust the ability of AI in
      the selection box in the upper right corner\u3002\n\nAnd click ready button
      for your own, than , start the game."
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e6a922eee25a64a578fefd5cc5ff89ce, type: 3}
  - title: Local mode
    body: 'Input all of your name here. (Optional)


      Click start game button.'
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e6a922eee25a64a578fefd5cc5ff89ce, type: 3}
  - title: Network Matching
    body: Click "start matching" button to match the human player, and click your
      "Ready" button before click start game.
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e6a922eee25a64a578fefd5cc5ff89ce, type: 3}
  - title: Cards
    body: 'Cards provide special actions.


      Control gates.


      Claim land.


      Strengthen
      towers.


      Disrupt opponents.'
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 62bf77a78e90f40dbb3a409f1a8c1103, type: 3}
  - title: Open Gate
    body: "Effect: Change one valid gate\u2019s direction or open path state to redirect
      enemy movement.\nDuration: Stays active until another valid gate effect changes
      it.\nNotes: Cannot be used on invalid, locked, or unavailable gates."
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 17bb6089b76cc44328920d2371c7b8eb, type: 3}
  - title: Lock Gate
    body: 'Effect: Lock one valid gate so its current path state cannot be changed
      immediately.

      Duration: Until the lock expires based on the gate card
      logic.

      Notes: During the turn it takes effect, players cannot change
      that same gate state.'
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a4b8e286a485645e29543133e21f1433, type: 3}
  - title: Power Boost
    body: 'Effect: Choose one owned tower. The tower deals increased damage during
      the next enemy wave.

      Duration: One wave only.

      Notes: Cannot stack
      on the same tower.'
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44790ff686fcb4e3a8aa19aad1df3e1c, type: 3}
  - title: Freeze Claim
    body: "Effect: Freeze one claimable land tile. The tile cannot be bought, taken
      over, used for tower building or interaction. Existed tower will stop attacking
      temporarily.\nDuration: Until the freezing player\u2019s next turn begins.\nNotes:
      Ownership and existing tower remain unchanged."
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a75b79984d0834248aa1d110600e1a7f, type: 3}
  - title: Shock Trap
    body: 'Effect: Place a trap on a valid route node. When triggered, it explodes
      and deals area damage to enemies inside its radius.

      Duration: Remains
      on the path until triggered.

      Notes: Damage is applied after the trigger
      delay, and the trap is destroyed after explosion.'
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9275df7b01e94473a8d18024b4376a31, type: 3}
  - title: Take Over
    body: "Effect: Take control of an opponent-owned claimable land tile at a discounted
      takeover cost. Any tower on that tile is removed.\nDuration: Ownership is permanent
      until changed again by another valid effect.\nNotes: The taken land activates
      on the player\u2019s next turn."
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5cc3aef429c314c6f9683b19e29530b6, type: 3}
  - title: Steal Card
    body: "Effect: Steal one random card from another player\u2019s hand.\nDuration:
      Instant effect.\nNotes: Cannot target yourself. Target must have at least one
      card, and your hand must not be full."
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 324aabb81867f4221a0622ed2623fdb5, type: 3}
  - title: Disrupt
    body: "Effect: Target player gets only 1 AP on their next turn and cannot draw,
      play, or discard cards during that turn.\nDuration: Target player\u2019s next
      turn only.\nNotes: Does not block gold actions such as buying land or building
      towers."
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7b165e11e6fed41198c5cdf9ecd12d60, type: 3}
  - title: Towers
    body: Towers attack enemies automatically. Build them on owned land.
    image: {fileID: 9098495111528537355, guid: decc763589a9a4272a06e7eb413c1d6b, type: 3}
  - title: Archer Tower
    body: "Role\n\nFast attack speed and excellent sustained damage.\n\nStrengths\n\n\u2713
      Highest attack speed\n\n\u2713 Great against large enemy groups\n\n\u2713 Efficient
      for its cost\n\nWeaknesses\n\n\u2717 Low damage per shot\n\n\u2717 Struggles
      against high-health enemies"
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: af760266c38374f3087d3bc347e141b9, type: 3}
  - title: Cannon Tower
    body: "Role\n\nBalanced tower with reliable damage and range.\n\nStrengths\n\n\u2713
      Cheap to build\n\n\u2713 Good all-around performance\n\n\u2713 Flexible placement
      options\n\nWeaknesses\n\n\u2717 No special effects\n\n\u2717 Outperformed by
      specialized towers later"
    image: {fileID: 8065531598386256854, guid: decc763589a9a4272a06e7eb413c1d6b, type: 3}
  - title: Frost Tower
    body: "Role\n\nSlows enemies and helps nearby towers deal more damage.\n\nStrengths\n\n\u2713
      Slows enemy movement\n\n\u2713 Improves overall defense efficiency\n\n\u2713
      Low construction cost\n\nWeaknesses\n\n\u2717 Low direct damage\n\n\u2717 Cannot
      stop enemies alone"
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b944aeaefc8c940f39e732b56e02906e, type: 3}
  - title: Shock Tower
    body: "Role\n\nDeals splash damage to clustered enemies.\n\nStrengths\n\n\u2713
      Hits multiple enemies\n\n\u2713 Strong against dense waves\n\n\u2713 High burst
      potential\n\nWeaknesses\n\n\u2717 Expensive\n\n\u2717 Slow attack speed"
    image: {fileID: -965518118754593934, guid: bdb0f320674034cddb4c7aa14f4cc00e, type: 3}
  - title: Sniper Tower
    body: "Role\n\nTargets dangerous enemies from a distance.\n\nStrengths\n\n\u2713
      Longest range\n\n\u2713 Highest single-target damage\n\n\u2713 Excellent against
      elite enemies\n\nWeaknesses\n\n\u2717 Slow attack speed\n\n\u2717 Overkill
      against weak enemies"
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 274cfd7f7302c401ea5879d4c33e542c, type: 3}
  - title: Enemies
    body: Different enemies have different speed, health, and rewards.
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cc3533145cea3445dbf1da78c37e1d5b, type: 3}
  - title: Normal Enemy
    body: "Balanced enemy unit.\n\nHP: 6\nSpeed: Medium\n\nThreat: \u2605\u2606\u2606\u2606\u2606\n\nAppears
      in most waves."
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cc3533145cea3445dbf1da78c37e1d5b, type: 3}
  - title: Fast Enemy
    body: "Moves very quickly but has low HP.\n\nHP: 6\nSpeed: Very Fast\n\nThreat:
      \u2605\u2605\u2606\u2606\u2606\n\nCan slip past slow towers."
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cc3533145cea3445dbf1da78c37e1d5b, type: 3}
  - title: Tank Enemy
    body: "High HP and armor.\n\nHP: 16\nArmor: 2\n\nThreat: \u2605\u2605\u2605\u2606\u2606\n\nRequires
      sustained damage."
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cc3533145cea3445dbf1da78c37e1d5b, type: 3}
  - title: Splitter Enemy
    body: "Splits into 2 enemies on death.\n\nHP: 12\nSplit Count: 2\n\nThreat: \u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2606\n\nCan
      overwhelm weak defenses."
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cc3533145cea3445dbf1da78c37e1d5b, type: 3}
  - title: Boss Enemy
    body: "Extremely durable enemy.\n\nHP: 60\nArmor: 4\n\nThreat: \u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\n\nHighest-priority
      target."
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cc3533145cea3445dbf1da78c37e1d5b, type: 3}
