  m_text: 'Protect your castle, earn score, and outplay the other players.


    Each
    player controls one castle and competes for the highest score. You can buy land,
    build towers, upgrade defenses, control gates, and use cards to influence the
    battlefield.


    The game is not only about survival. You also need to manage
    resources, redirect enemy routes, and interfere with other players at the right
    time.'
